  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed conversion would result in an over-intensive use of the property which, by reason of associated disturbance and general activity, would detract from the residential amenities of the occupiers of neighbouring properties and be out of character in the locality. Furthermore, the proposals fail to provide private amenity space for each inividual flat.&amp;nbsp; As such, the development is contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2023), policies D3 D(5)(7) and D6(A)(C)(D) of The London Plan (2021), policies DM1, DM26 and DM27 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013), the Mayor of London Supplementary Planning Guidance Housing (2016), The London Plan Guidance: and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
